*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0002
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 664
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CLM0002C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> SPECIAL INVESTIGATIONS REFERRAL
    05 WS-SIU             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 CS-CD              PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM NO-REPORT-CHECK
    PERFORM 3100-CLAIM-FREQ
    DISPLAY "WS-SIU=" WS-SIU
    DISPLAY "CS-CD=" CS-CD
    STOP RUN.
NO-REPORT-CHECK.
    IF IN-L-TY = 'A'
       AND IN-PR-FLG = 'N'
       AND IN-WS-CLAM > 7500
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
        MOVE 'I' TO CS-CD
    END-IF.
3100-CLAIM-FREQ.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF IN-P-CC >= 2
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> FREQUENT CLAIMANT
    IF IN-P-CC >= 3
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
    END-IF.
